		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Non à priori. Les détails de l&#039;erreur disent :</p><p>Backing up an object on the server &#039;PostgreSQL 10 (localhost : 5432)&#039; from database &#039;NOMDB&#039;...</p><p>--file &quot;C:\\[chemin complet]\\DUMP_B~1.SQL&quot; --host &quot;localhost&quot; --port &quot;5432&quot; --username &quot;name&quot; --no-password --verbose --format=p --encoding &quot;UTF8&quot; &quot;NOMDB&quot;</p><p>Start time: Thu Jun 09 2022 18:11:32 GMT+0200 (Paris, Madrid (heure d’été)</p><p>Status : Failed (exit code: 1)</p><p>Merci,</p>]]></content>
